#12914
parts companion jagged eventide elemental~
jagged eventide elemental companion parts~
Some jagged eventide elemental companion parts are here.~
   These modular parts are used to construct an eventide elemental companion,
which you can summon and dismiss like any other companion. This elemental lasts
until it is destroyed. Each elemental is built from up to 3 modules. This
module adds melee combat capabilities:
   1 jagged module: It gains the ability to attack in combat.
   2 jagged modules: Increases its damage and adds 'order companion actuate'
      to debuff the enemy.
   3 jagged modules: Increases its damage and makes it immune to disarm.
   Combining a jagged and magnetic module will also boost its damage.
~
