#12915
parts companion magnetic eventide elemental~
magnetic eventide elemental companion parts~
Some magnetic eventide elemental parts are here.~
   These modular parts are used to construct an eventide elemental companion,
which you can summon and dismiss like any other companion. This elemental lasts
until it is destroyed. Each elemental is built from up to 3 modules. This
module adds casting capabilities:
   1 magnetic module: Adds 'order companion magnetize', which buffs you.
   2 magnetic modules: Increases the potency of its buffs and, if combined with
      a jagged module, changes the melee attack to a magical one.
   3 magnetic modules: Increases the buffs again and makes them automatic.
   Combining a jagged and magnetic module will also boost its damage.
~
