An unfallen meteor hovers in the air.~
   A soft mist falls from the rough, rocky meteor. The object is small enough
to fit in a pocket, cold to the touch, and smoother in your hands than its
pock-marked surface appears. It's a delicate thing, with a metallic sheen.
   The unfallen meteor is a crafting material for Impact Forging.
